// CROATOA_FIRBOLG_SENTRY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4129813663" "These woods are ours!"
// CROATOA_FIRBOLG_SENTRY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1609293697" "The Fir Bolg reign here!"
// CROATOA_FIRBOLG_SENTRY_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2742313434" "Go, and never come back!"

// CROATOA_FIRBOLG_FROM_ABOVE_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2559561066" "I will tear you apart!"
